00:05:39,940 --> 00:05:40,640
35 minutes.

99
00:05:40,640 --> 00:05:42,620
So wish me luck.

100
00:05:42,620 --> 00:05:44,500
Thank you.

101
00:05:44,500 --> 00:05:51,320
Father in heaven, Father, Abba, in heaven, the place where you dwell eternally, the God

102
00:05:51,320 --> 00:05:53,260
who was and is and is to come.

103
00:05:53,260 --> 00:05:56,920
We humble ourselves before you today.

104
00:05:56,920 --> 00:05:58,920
We come into your presence expectant.

105
00:05:59,340 --> 00:06:00,360
We want to hear from you.

